      <p className="mb-2 text-justify pl-4 font-merriweather text-[14px] leading-normal text-[#9aa1b0] border-l-2 border-white/30 my-2 py-1"><span className="font-bold text-white mr-2">(02/02/2026)</span>Article 8 Added Full Procedures for a Civil Trial to include Civil Cases (Lawsuits and Claims) where a Hearing or Arbitration is not sufficient. ​ ​</p>
