      <p className="mb-2 text-justify pl-4 font-merriweather text-[14px] leading-normal text-[#9aa1b0] border-l-2 border-white/30 my-2 py-1"><span className="font-bold text-white mr-2">(02/02/2026)</span>9.1.2 Changed wording and added 9.1.2 c) as requirement for The Department of Justice and/or Government to have two other Lawyers available to respond as Public Defenders to calls outside of the Bench Trial and to provide Legal Advice to Citizens at the Capitol. ​</p>
